      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "They will never do that. That would be pretty terrible. Mirrors can you lag since they essentially duplicate avatars to show their 'reflection'. People's spawned mirrors would drop your frames a ton, why would you want that?\nJust tell your friend to drop a mirror in the same place as you, it's what we always did in the past when you could spawn your own mirrors 'with other methods' and it worked fine.",
