  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-08-09T11:25:41.982Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Hello, I would like the mirror to have a local or public option set on an toggle. I haven't seen if this is already done yet but if not I would really appreciate it. I'd also like the ability to reflect off another mirror being able to see the back of an avatar using 2 mirrors would be so nice.\nThank you",
